    "message": "Count waits for an absent worker as waits for someone not working\n\nWhile the only support worker was away (set_staff_availability),\nrequests waited and timed out, yet no wait-reason KPI counted it, and\nthe busy-staff wait even looked shorter (#74).\n\nInstead of adding a KPI, widen the off-shift reason to every qualified\nworker who is not working now: outside a shift window or away. The\nlabels now read 勤務していない資格者がいる支援待ち依頼分数（時間外・不在）.\nThe metric key and record format stay the same; saved Runs keep their\nvalues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
